and unlock failed ECDICT responses while retaining the primary error and valid caches.\n- Reject unrelated selection gestures and invalid snapshot activation; keep confirmation focus stable during refresh.\n- Harden test isolation, bundle checks and smoke verdicts. This release closes TEST-001–004, BUG-001–007 and UX-001; RISK-001 has defensive hardening with its native trigger still unreproduced.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Fresh isolated regression: **70 files / 1739 passed / 0 failed or skipped**. Legacy P01–P07 was not executed because of its historical Git/default-runtime assumptions.\n- Actual installed **DSH 0.2.1-rc.3**, newly created isolated **Web profile**: **22/22 checks passed**, including native keyboard dispatch, real Fixture SQLite lookup, settings, measured rendering/scrolling, authenticated uninstall proof and instrumented network windows.\n- Production build, types, 100/100 bundle checks, exact eight-member tarball verification and real companion Worker integrity/handle release passed.\n\n## Scope and limitations\n\n- Desktop profile, rollback, earlier runtimes and full ECDICT/performance remain unverified. The full corpus is not shipped.\n- Known F03 settings-sync crash window and optional selection OS/DPI/escape limitations remain disclosed.\n- A DSH core session-maybe adapter error was reproduced without this plugin when a browser stays open across a forced Host restart; live-browser reconnect recovery is outside the compatibility claim.\n- On the measured Windows Node runtimes, keep full SQLite/candidate paths **below 260 characters**. The 34 long-root test failures, 262-character diagnostic and successful short-root rerun are preserved.\n\n## npm package handoff\n\nnpm upload is performed separately by the maintainer with 2FA. Download the attached `.tgz`; `publish-npm.ps1` verifies its SHA-256 before invoking the local npm CLI. The agent has not executed npm publish.\n\n```powershell\nnpm publish \".\\dsh-word-lookup-0.2.2.tgz\" --access public --tag latest --registry https://registry.npmjs.org/ --ignore-scripts\n```\n\nTarball SHA-256: `30b46d3c8dcf356c29b763c62882eb882a363d49ee0afb27201d25e0b2c08b45`\nSource commit: `080085b21c15f85bb93a6af8847353e2b1992451`\n\n[Release notes](https://github.com/HaowenCang/dsh-word-lookup/blob/v0.2.2/docs/releases/v0.2.2.md)\n\nPublication evidence ID: github-publication-20261025-0027e4f130\n"}